@startuml

actor User

package SOFTWARE_SET {
    usecase config_path as "Config the specific send paths and receive paths"
    usecase config_speed as "Config speed of sync"
}

note left of (config_speed)
    if you prefer performance, rise up it;
    otherwise, reduce it can lower CPU background usage.
end note

note right of (config_path)
    you can link different dirs to sync
end note


User -down-> config_path
User -down-> config_speed



@enduml
